# --- V8 parallel-run sizing ratio -------------------------------------------------------------
# Scales the sizing inputs relative to the v7 script running simultaneously: each config's
# dollar_target / size_target / max_size (floor 1 contract where numeric) and the per-script
# loss cap (MAX_LOSS_CAP_355). The GLOBAL loss cap is NOT scaled: the global check counts ALL
# scripts' positions (full-size v7 books included), so a scaled global cap would read as
# exhausted and collapse every v8 trade to the 1-lot floor. 1.0 = same size as v7.
